      {
         "id": "c",
         "prompt": "The rectangle is the base of a box whose height at time \\( t \\) is \\( H(t) = 2t + 1 \\) centimeters. The volume of the box is \\( V(t) = L(t)\\,W(t)\\,H(t) \\). Find \\( V'(3) \\). Show the work that leads to your answer.",
         "setup_required": false,
         "answer_latex": "V'(3) = 5",
         "worked_solution": [
            {
               "text": "Product rule for three factors, with H'(t) = 2.",
               "latex": "V'(t) = L'(t)\\,W(t)\\,H(t) + L(t)\\,W'(t)\\,H(t) + L(t)\\,W(t)\\,H'(t)"
            },
            {
               "text": "Substitute the values at t = 3, where H(3) = 7.",
               "latex": "V'(3) = 1 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 7 + 16 \\cdot (-1) \\cdot 7 + 16 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 2 = 5"
            }
